# 🌊 {{ projectName }}

A [Lockness JS](https://lockness.land) application.

## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
# Terminal 1: CSS Watcher
deno task css:watch

# Terminal 2: Development Server
deno task dev
```

Open [http://localhost:8888](http://localhost:8888)

## 📁 Project Structure

```
{{ projectName }}/
├── app/
│   ├── controller/      # HTTP handlers
│   └── view/            # JSX pages & components
├── public/              # Static assets (CSS, images)
└── main.ts              # Application entry point
```

## 🛠️ Common Commands

| Command                        | Description                    |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ |
| `deno task dev`                | Start development server       |
| `deno task css:watch`          | Watch & compile CSS            |
| `deno task cli make:controller User` | Create a controller      |
| `deno task cli router:list`    | Display all routes             |

## 📦 Adding Features

Install additional packages as needed:

```bash
# Add Drizzle ORM for database
deno task cli package:install drizzle

# Add authentication
deno task cli package:install auth

# Add OpenAPI documentation
deno task cli package:install openapi
```

## 🚢 Production

```bash
# Build assets
deno task build

# Run production server
deno task start

# Or compile to binary
deno task compile
```

## 📖 Documentation

Full documentation: [lockness.land/docs](https://lockness.land/docs)
